==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[chronic]] [[intoxication]] that is produced by the [[absorption]] of [[lead]] into the [[body]] and is characterized by severe [[colicky]] pains, a dark line along the [[gum]]s, and local [[muscular]] [[paralysis]].

